<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="fc21946d">&lt;p&gt;
    Configure the package application according to configuration parameters for the business environment or function. This
    typically includes the metadata and data structures the application will operate in, like a chart of accounts, legal
    entities, organizational structure or reporting dimensional hierarchy. Configure basic solution functionality for each
    of the functional teams so basic processes can be tested. Refer to guidance documents for any package specific
    considerations.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    This is the starting point to allow testing to begin. Some details of configuration settings may not be known at this
    time, but the basic configuration can be completed.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
</Element>
